H=[
("safety","easy","You mopped the lobby floor. What must go out before you walk away?","Trapeaste el piso del lobby. ¿Qué debes poner antes de irte?",["A wet-floor sign","A trash can","A luggage cart","Nothing"],["Un letrero de piso mojado","Un bote de basura","Un carrito de maletas","Nada"],"Wet floors are a top cause of guest and staff falls.","Los pisos mojados son de las principales causas de caídas.",SLIP),
("safety","med","When is the best time to mop the lobby?","¿Cuál es el mejor momento para trapear el lobby?",["During slow times, one section at a time, with signs","During morning checkout rush","All at once at peak hours","Only when a guest complains"],["En horas tranquilas, por secciones y con letreros","Durante las salidas de la mañana","Todo de una vez en hora pico","Solo cuando se queja un huésped"],"Working in sections leaves a dry path for guests.","Trabajar por secciones deja un camino seco para los huéspedes.",SLIP),
("winter","easy","Snow is being tracked in at the entrance. What helps most?","Están metiendo nieve en la entrada. ¿Qué ayuda más?",["Put down absorbent mats and dry the area often","Leave it to melt","Open the doors wider","Spread towels from the rooms"],["Poner tapetes absorbentes y secar seguido","Dejar que se derrita","Abrir más las puertas","Poner toallas de los cuartos"],"Entry mats and frequent drying prevent winter slip-and-falls.","Los tapetes de entrada y secar seguido evitan caídas en invierno.",COLD,("11-01","04-01")),
("winter","med","The sidewalk by the door is icy at 6 a.m. What should you do?","La banqueta junto a la puerta está congelada a las 6 a.m. ¿Qué haces?",["Apply ice melt per instructions and tell the front desk","Wait for the sun","Pour hot water on it","Put a chair there"],["Echar sal o derretidor según instrucciones y avisar a recepción","Esperar al sol","Echarle agua caliente","Poner una silla"],"Hot water refreezes into more ice. Use ice melt and warn the desk.","El agua caliente se vuelve a congelar. Usa derretidor y avisa a recepción.",COLD,("11-01","04-01")),
("chemicals","med","You're refilling a spray bottle from a larger jug. What must the bottle have?","Estás rellenando una botella desde un galón. ¿Qué debe tener la botella?",["A label naming the chemical and its hazards","Nothing, you'll remember","A guest's room number","Your initials only"],["Una etiqueta con el nombre del químico y sus riesgos","Nada, ya te vas a acordar","El número de un cuarto","Solo tus iniciales"],"Secondary containers must be labeled so anyone who picks it up knows what it is.","Los envases secundarios deben estar etiquetados para que cualquiera sepa qué contienen.",HAZ),
("trash","med","A trash bag feels heavy and sharp items poke through. How do you carry it?","Una bolsa de basura pesa y se asoman cosas filosas. ¿Cómo la cargas?",["Away from your body, not against your legs; double-bag if needed","Hug it close","Swing it over your shoulder","Drag it on the floor"],["Lejos del cuerpo, no pegada a las piernas; usa doble bolsa si hace falta","Abrazarla","Echártela al hombro","Arrastrarla por el piso"],"Broken glass and needles in trash cause cuts. Keep bags off your body.","Los vidrios y agujas en la basura causan cortadas. Mantén las bolsas lejos del cuerpo.",BBP),
("trash","easy","Where should trash and dirty linen carts never be left?","¿Dónde nunca deben quedarse los carritos de basura o ropa sucia?",["Blocking hallways, exits or fire doors","In the back hall","In the service elevator area when moving","In the trash room"],["Bloqueando pasillos, salidas o puertas contra incendio","En el pasillo de servicio","Junto al elevador de servicio cuando los mueves","En el cuarto de basura"],"Exits and fire doors must stay clear at all times.","Las salidas y puertas contra incendio deben estar libres siempre.","https://www.osha.gov/exit-routes"),
("public","easy","What areas should you check on every public-area round?","¿Qué áreas debes revisar en cada ronda de áreas públicas?",["Lobby restrooms, entrance, elevators and ice/vending areas","Only the GM's office","Guest rooms","The roof"],["Baños del lobby, entrada, elevadores y áreas de hielo y máquinas","Solo la oficina del gerente","Los cuartos","El techo"],"Public spaces shape first impressions. Regular rounds keep them guest-ready.","Las áreas públicas dan la primera impresión. Las rondas las mantienen listas.",BP),
("public","med","A guest gets sick in the elevator. What do you do first?","Un huésped vomita en el elevador. ¿Qué haces primero?",["Take that elevator out of service, put on gloves, and clean with the body-fluid kit","Wipe it with a dry rag","Leave it for night shift","Spray air freshener only"],["Sacar ese elevador de servicio, ponerte guantes y limpiar con el kit de fluidos","Limpiarlo con un trapo seco","Dejárselo al turno de noche","Solo echar aromatizante"],"Body fluids need PPE and a disinfectant made for them.","Los fluidos corporales requieren equipo de protección y un desinfectante adecuado.",BBP),
("ergonomics","med","You need to move a heavy furniture piece alone. What's best?","Necesitas mover un mueble pesado tú solo. ¿Qué es lo mejor?",["Get a coworker or a dolly — don't lift it alone","Lift fast to get it over with","Drag it across carpet with your back","Ask a guest"],["Pedir ayuda a un compañero o usar un diablito; no lo levantes solo","Levantarlo rápido para acabar","Arrastrarlo con la espalda","Pedirle a un huésped"],"Team lifts and carts prevent back injuries.","Levantar en equipo o con carrito evita lesiones de espalda.",LIFT),
("ladder","med","You need to dust a high light fixture. What's safe?","Tienes que sacudir una lámpara alta. ¿Qué es lo seguro?",["Use a proper ladder or extension duster, not a chair","Stand on a desk chair with wheels","Climb on the luggage cart","Stand on the top step of the ladder"],["Usar una escalera adecuada o un plumero extensible, no una silla","Pararte en una silla con ruedas","Subirte al carrito de maletas","Pararte en el último escalón"],"Chairs and carts roll. Use the right ladder and never the top step.","Las sillas y carritos ruedan. Usa la escalera correcta y nunca el último escalón.",LAD),
("guest","easy","A guest asks where the ice machine is while you're vacuuming. What do you do?","Un huésped te pregunta dónde está la máquina de hielo mientras aspiras. ¿Qué haces?",["Turn off the vacuum, smile, and give clear directions","Keep vacuuming and point","Say you don't know","Tell them to ask the desk"],["Apagar la aspiradora, sonreír y explicar bien","Seguir aspirando y señalar","Decir que no sabes","Mandarlo a recepción"],"Stopping to help shows guests they matter.","Detenerte a ayudar le demuestra al huésped que importa.",BP),
("pool","med","You notice the pool water is cloudy and you can't see the bottom. What should happen?","Notas que el agua de la alberca está turbia y no se ve el fondo. ¿Qué debe pasar?",["Report it right away — the pool may need to close until it's clear","Swim to check","Add bleach from housekeeping","Ignore it"],["Reportarlo de inmediato; quizá se deba cerrar hasta que se aclare","Nadar para revisar","Echarle cloro de limpieza","Ignorarlo"],"Minnesota requires the main drain to be visible; cloudy water is a safety hazard.","En Minnesota se debe ver el desagüe del fondo; el agua turbia es un riesgo.",POOL),
("public","med","Restroom paper towels are out during a busy event. What's the priority?","Se acabaron las toallas de papel del baño durante un evento. ¿Qué es lo prioritario?",["Restock right away and add more frequent checks","Wait for the next round","Leave a note","Tell guests to use the room"],["Reponer de inmediato y revisar más seguido","Esperar a la siguiente ronda","Dejar una nota","Decirle a los huéspedes que usen su cuarto"],"Busy times need more frequent rounds.","En horas de mucha gente hay que hacer más rondas.",BP),
("security","med","You see a door to the back hallway propped open with a wedge. What do you do?","Ves una puerta del pasillo de servicio detenida con una cuña. ¿Qué haces?",["Remove the wedge, close it, and tell your supervisor","Leave it for airflow","Prop more doors","Lock yourself out"],["Quitar la cuña, cerrarla y avisar a tu supervisora","Dejarla para que entre aire","Abrir más puertas","Quedarte afuera"],"Propped doors let anyone in and defeat fire doors.","Las puertas detenidas dejan entrar a cualquiera y anulan las puertas contra incendio.",BP),
("electrical","med","The vacuum cord is frayed with wire showing. What do you do?","El cable de la aspiradora está pelado y se ve el alambre. ¿Qué haces?",["Stop using it, tag it out and report it","Tape it and keep going","Use it only on carpet","Wrap it in a towel"],["Dejar de usarla, marcarla fuera de servicio y reportarla","Ponerle cinta y seguir","Usarla solo en alfombra","Envolverla en una toalla"],"Damaged cords can shock or start fires.","Los cables dañados pueden dar toques o causar incendios.",ELEC),
("shampoo","med","After shampooing carpet in the hallway, what should you do?","Después de lavar la alfombra del pasillo, ¿qué debes hacer?",["Put up signs and use fans so it dries quickly","Leave it soaked","Close the hallway for a week","Lay towels on top"],["Poner letreros y ventiladores para que seque rápido","Dejarla empapada","Cerrar el pasillo una semana","Poner toallas encima"],"Damp carpet is slippery and can grow mildew.","La alfombra húmeda resbala y puede hacer moho.",SLIP),
("trash","med","Why keep the trash room or dumpster area tidy and closed?","¿Por qué mantener limpio y cerrado el cuarto de basura o el contenedor?",["It keeps pests and smells away","Guests like to see it","It's only for looks","So the truck skips it"],["Mantiene lejos plagas y olores","A los huéspedes les gusta verlo","Solo es por apariencia","Para que el camión no pase"],"Open dumpsters attract rodents and insects.","Los contenedores abiertos atraen ratas e insectos.",BP),
("guest","med","A guest in the lobby looks lost and upset. What should you do?","Un huésped en el lobby se ve perdido y molesto. ¿Qué haces?",["Ask if you can help and walk them to the front desk if needed","Look away","Tell them to calm down","Keep cleaning"],["Preguntarle si le puedes ayudar y llevarlo a recepción si hace falta","Voltear para otro lado","Decirle que se calme","Seguir limpiando"],"Every staff member can be the one who turns a bad moment around.","Cualquiera del equipo puede cambiar un mal momento.",BP),
("ice","med","Why shouldn't the ice scoop be stored inside the ice bin?","¿Por qué no se debe guardar la pala del hielo dentro del depósito?",["Hands touch the handle and can contaminate the ice","It melts the ice","It's too heavy","It makes noise"],["Las manos tocan el mango y pueden contaminar el hielo","Derrite el hielo","Pesa mucho","Hace ruido"],"Ice is food. Keep the scoop in its holder.","El hielo es alimento. Guarda la pala en su soporte.",FC),
]
for t in H: n(HM,*t)
